dex=5\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>哈尔滨工程大学</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>物理学院夏令营</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2026</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/4BF1BgzCefj1hibvYAZ6mwb5Su8G6P5NNCd3OgDKlbjUD1tM4jl0SZOG7xxInQrfeiaW7eU0VRkhFQDfVB4Ol8oxcbCuWQBltyTGSblGzGe24/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=6\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>●</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营活</span><span>动时间</span><span>（预计）</span><span>：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>2026年7月8日（全天）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学校简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>哈尔滨工程大学源自1953年创办的中国人民解放军军事工程学院（\"哈军工\"），陈赓大将为首任院长，毛泽东主席为学院颁发《训词》，是国家历批次重点建设的高校。</span></span></p><p><span><span>【首批】进入国家\"211工程\"重点建设高校，国家\"985工程\"优势学科创新平台项目建设高校（工信部直属、\"国防七子\"之一）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>【首批】进入国家\"双一流\"建设行列（一流学科建设高校）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><span>SCHOOL Introduction</span></em></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hHDGiaEtmxFezKxLUUpUuykQyNDLVPMz4cHCEnVkLplUk6QA3JQzkS2mnY7vovjm7GJj3bibvork7M3HpmaPK5InnAiakzgQeTacZ5saRJtrMQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>哈尔滨工程大学物理与光电工程学院起源于学校建校之初的物理教授会，历经基础部、理学院等发展阶段，2019年正式成立物理与光电工程学院。学院秉承“大工至善，大学至真”校训，坚持“陆海联动、光声协同”发展理念，以海洋光学与光纤技术为特色，逐步建成国内光学工程与物理学领域的重要人才培养和科学研究基地。</span></p><p><span>近年来，学院学科综合实力显著跃升：光学工程学科在第五轮学科评估中位居全国前30%，物理学学科ESI排名持续攀升，全球机构研究热度进入前1%。学院以“场景驱动创新”为牵引，聚焦海洋强国与光电技术自主化战略，全力打造特色凸显的理工融合学科高地。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>人才队伍</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>学院现有专任教师119人，其中国家级领军人才7人，省部级优秀人才15人（含龙江学者特聘教授、省教学名师等）。学院现有外籍教师3人，具有海外经历的教师占比逐年提升，形成了一支结构合理、锐意创新的教学科研团队。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>科研平台</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院建有多个</span><span>国家</span><span>级与省部级科研教学平台，支撑高水平原始创新与工程应用：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hHDGiaEtmxFdCp0YzdZOSKicCFbmIlL9ibXpvb4L9mHgGQCURhXia1HKS9hSLRicNQJgFXI6pibtvUrcQR5JTicx59amSNxhjkY39CYmFjSm9kh8hQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"8\"><section><section><p><strong><span>学院平台</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>物理国家级实</span><span>验教</span><span>学示范中心</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>全国科技辅导员培训基地</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>全国科普教育基地</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>“纤维集成光学”教育部重点实验室 </span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>“海洋光子材料与器件物理”工业和信息化部重点实验室</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><font><span>“光纤传感科学与技术”黑龙江省重点实验室</span></font></td></tr><tr><td><font><span>“面向工程应用的微结构功能光纤”教育部创新引智基地</span></font></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>黑龙江省科普教育基地</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><p><span>学院科研设备先进，平台条件完备，为师生提供一流的实验与创新环境。</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>科学研究</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hHDGiaEtmxFelZtwWsLawzvTVyOInBs8PleHzQhHjiccgPdPexKYp5DfEIpR7ggmsPT91cslAuzrWB8VVUXo9u05OShULDkjuiaicfW3qUmFWYc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院坚持以基础研究和应用基础研究并重，面向海洋探测、核防护、新能源、集成电路等国家重大需求，形成了纤维集成光学、光纤传感与光学测量、光子材料与器件、中红外光子学等特色优势方向。近五年发表SCI论文805篇，物理学领域研究热度位居全球机构前1%；在《Nature Photonics》</span></span></p><p><span><span>《Science Advances》《Nature Communications》等顶级期刊发表论文多篇，学院教师入选ScholarGPS“全球前0.05%顶尖学者”榜单。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hHDGiaEtmxFcEHzicyeqiar7aLZtRIC7PTV2MfmhrXGj00QafMess0f8MOpWryM1BV1icTIrwbB8n1hG7ImFADgomtLwuGWdELibgd2n8Emb5188/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>“十四五”期间，学院科研立项数和经费到款数质双升，获国家自然科学基金青年基金A类、国家重大科研仪器研制项目、重点项目等标志性项目，授权专利转化金额持续增长，孵化“哈船光科”“哈船智光”等科技成果转化企业，深度服务行业与区域经济。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>社会服务</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hHDGiaEtmxFeOLppxEbI6GGdOiaVXGHZgZ2QqyfPFGJayQCYUXHfA0Xge541trpqx8N5zkhicxCV0aCTL6jBiaVZdfbXJEgw5EicYSibLCpicS26Qc/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学院立足国防、面向全国，构建“科教融合、科普惠民”的社会服务体系。依托国家级科普教育基地，打造“工程特色科普王牌”，自研仪器辐射全国，年开展科普活动超50场次。暑期“三下乡”社会实践团队多次获团中央表彰，新闻被中青校园、黑龙江日报等主流媒体转载60余次。学院成功承办中国物理学会2025秋季学术会议（参会代表约5000人，含院士21人），主办IEEE国际光通信与网络会议等高端学术活动，学术影响力和社会声誉持续提升。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究生培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Graduate Education</span></em></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hHDGiaEtmxFempgvHT6IpD8rTPAn6HjUCaJ6Y2q0zm9lTSIiaWvgxSyBfTeWkk4bUGhjiaq4BHVa9dpJT3FFlObuCWd4RBYvonhvZIVzu6ErQg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span>学院以培养“追求卓越、使命担当”的高层次创新人才为目标，深化硕博贯通培养，强化科教产教融合，构建具有哈工程特色的光电领域研究生教育体系。</span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>研究生专业</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>学院现设有“光学工程”“物理学”2个一级学科硕士学位授权点和“电子信息”硕士专业学位授予类别，具有“光学工程”1个一级学科博士学位授权点和“电子信息”博士专业学位授予类别，建有“光学工程”博士后科研流动站。光学工程学科为工业和信息化部“新兴交叉”学科、黑龙江省重点学科。布局水下光学传输、智能光子学、先进封装与微纳系统集成等新兴前沿方向，形成“陆海联动、光声协同”的鲜明特色。</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>培养成果</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hHDGiaEtmxFcFSKKUqhNdAG3ScmCsj1VWaV2tPibBQveBkaEVDb1k2v0fpeXjN2DcKKrCXvpWFicZGU3DlNia885wfKIPVvu82uicfd8w6nzIorc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>研究生培养质量持续提升，近五年硕博毕业生就业率保持高位，博士毕业生连续实现100%就业，且赴军工集团及部队就业比例逐年攀升。学生在学科竞赛中屡获佳绩，斩获中国研究生电子设计大赛国赛一等奖2项、全国大学生光电设计竞赛一等奖等高级别奖项。优秀学子不断涌现：多位研究生分别获得“中国大学生自强之星”、全国高校“百名研究生党员标兵”、王大珩光学奖、中国科协青年托举人才工程入选者、黑龙江省优秀毕业生及全国光学与光学工程博士生学术联赛百强等荣誉。研究生以主要作者身份在《Nature》《Science》子刊等顶级期刊发表论文10余篇，着力培养了研究生的科研创新能力。</span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学术活动</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hHDGiaEtmxFer0ueXwh2kOA4oroDSia3LdHskibdRpeS5bNH8bzvoAStiaGRzZxIM3Y8Q47XUBUVBqgobicdL7AVAYSICTPOcZiaw8vgBSITED6rE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学院打造国际化、常态化的学术交流平台。每年组织各类学术报告、讲座数十场，支持研究生参加国际国内会议累计122人次，口头报告65人次。与澳大利亚国立大学、德国明斯特大学、香港理工大学等建立联合培养机制，联合培养博士生13人。定期举办“水下光学探测前沿论坛”“军工光电青年学者沙龙”等特色学术活动，拓宽学生学术视野。</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学生就业</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hHDGiaEtmxFdQEKVflJ2P8E2bHZ8t8Y1vBVWaga0dV6ia1Wd3lnAV1U2FpIYJGUfUtz8tS0F3Ruzpia1GLBGWNYsIYamOk7RWS61wVEPSLaJ3Y/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p><span>硕士毕业生就业率稳定在95%左右，其中约三分之一投身军工集团和部队；博士毕业生100%就业，军工集团和部队就业率由五年前的5%上升至15%。学院与航天科工、中船集团等共建研究生联合培养基地，实施“三个一线”育人模式，毕业生服务国防和区域经济发展比例超过50%。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营报名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><span>Recruitment</span></em></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hHDGiaEtmxFfnpARRMlk3OxIT9839vPpv5BF1vW0fMlptD7vNQcs6H8RYzVHqOkPJDO16tib4xNzWT0yQ57gculycBrpwYG9J6jWAc9XDcyZM/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>●报名时间：即日起—7月5日</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>●录取名单公布：2026年7月6日（学院官网公布）</span></span></p><p><span><span>●活动举办：</span></span><span><span>开营时间预计7月8日，具体时间请关注QQ群通知。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>●国内高校本科高年级（2023级）在校生，对本学科领域有浓厚兴趣，有意向攻读直博生或推免生者优先；</span></span></p><p><span>●拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，无任何处分记录；</span></p><p><span>●身心健康，学习优秀，思维敏捷，具有较强的科研创新潜力和实践能力；</span></p><p><span>●本科期间在核心期刊发表论文、获国家发明专利、参与科研项目或在省级及以上科技竞赛中获奖者优先考虑。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>●在线报名：在报名时间内登录哈尔滨工程大学物理与光电工程学院官网暑期学校专题页面，填写报名信息并上传相关证明材料（成绩单、获奖证书、学术成果等）。也可扫码调表提交报名</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hHDGiaEtmxFcsrkJ9JEFzTkEEhqYoGl0qicPQ9pTiajfia86euBInj3HmykSGwgW3OELnD0UsicJyQeok5ia8DbqXFP4ibYDMuxI1L0wguEG0XeYJo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>●选择会场：报名时须从“哈尔滨会场”（校本部理学楼）和“青岛会场”（青岛创新发展基地·光电前沿国际创新中心）中二选一，一经选定原则上不予更改。</span></p><p><span>●审核录取：学院工作小组对报名材料进行审核，于7月6日在学院官网公布入营名单，并通过QQ群、邮件或电话通知入选营员。</span></p><p><span>●</span><span>报名材料请发送到指定邮箱：wl_ge@qq.com，邮件主题请标明：暑期夏令营。有意报名的同学可先加QQ群：722076923。入群请备注暑期夏令营。</span></p><p><span>●</span><span>申报材料清单：（以下材料按照顺序合成一个PDF发送到邮箱wl_ge@qq.com）</span></p><p><span>1.个人简历（1页）；</span></p><p><span>2.成绩排名证明(请加盖学校教务部门或所在学院公章)；</span></p><p><span>3.截至目前本科阶段成绩单1份（请加盖教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>4.本人身份证和学生证复印件各一份；</span></p><p><span>5.国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL、GRE/GMAT等体现自身英语水平的证明1份；</span></p><p><span>6.其他相关证明材料(如获奖证书，发表或已录用的、能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果)。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动形式与内容</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>●双会场联动：哈尔滨主会场与青岛分会场通过线上直播同步举行上午的学院介绍、招生政策宣讲及学术团队报告；下午各会场分别组织本地重点实验室参观。</span></p><p><span>●交流环节：茶歇期间安排导师面对面交流，为营员提供深入了解学科方向和导师团队的机会。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><span>OthersInformation</span></em></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>●</span><span>学院为营员提供活动期间住宿费用、午餐及茶歇，并购买意外保险;往返交通由营员自理。</span></p><p><span>●优秀营员报销往返交通费用。</span></p><p><span>●咨询电话：0451-82519753（详情请关注学院官网）</span></p><p><span>●学院官网：</span></p><p><span>https://ss.hrbeu.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span>●官方公众号：哈工程物理与光电工程学院</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><span>【END】</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fIf00GSWqTbuBaugc8TZXMbKCVIZJeyGbHp1qxS0ibg8ptcsc0PQibCVJOe3o6iacb1AFQeq1PxqpK7pPjeHN0TBQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=18\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>图文|任永志</span></span></p><p><span><span>责编|董云吉</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核|孟  霆  张  羽</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"6c8844b690e5eb895530181d3438de48f7f4d5a8d7d5e5c78066c973b102344d","textLength":3317,"sourceSha256":"dcd5fea1cc82f15b261ad29e95be511288823c9bf8c50ef1c1c5a07be26025d0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4605761976e05389f40d","